{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2026-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1771718400, "end_date": 1772323199, "month_true_total": 280, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:57:41 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "219491161", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091967861", "personaname": "Wellbutrin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091967861/", "num_games_owned": 234, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1188, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1151, "last_played": 1784232696, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice, randomly loosing traits and amulet, overall the game is barely mid anyways.", "timestamp_created": 1772322249, "timestamp_updated": 1772322249, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481751799583435059", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "219478986", "author": {"steamid": "76561198350079568", "personaname": "SWITCHBLADE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/switchblade363/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 2432, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2432, "last_played": 1772041881, "avatar": "f3d05db4d8557efbcdbfb337f4176abe9fcb5c1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "has some BS bosses but overall a pretty fun game with diablo-style progression and soulslike levels and combat", "timestamp_created": 1772312672, "timestamp_updated": 1772312672, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219469034", "author": {"steamid": "76561199545849602", "personaname": "codemantlc", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199545849602/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7841, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7770, "last_played": 1785606921, "avatar": "3017f64da039e05834f718537fc1fba48efe92e6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is a lot of fun. The random generation of maps and changing gameplay makes it highly replayable. I enjoy a game with cool secrets and hidden items and this one delivers. It was fun to watch the devs and community interact when it came out. I hope we see a Remnant 3!!", "timestamp_created": 1772305587, "timestamp_updated": 1772305587, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219449779", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960447711", "personaname": "Rohkhos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/timmah20/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4324, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 93, "playtime_at_review": 3412, "last_played": 1788822159, "avatar": "56f38b91a890f8456172fe7cb99d8f8dc72892a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is just such a good, complete, awesome game. I have trouble finding ANYTHING wrong with it, which is hard to say about almost any game. It may not exactly be your cup of tea subjectively, but the game itself is so well made, so polished, with such great detail. It has an interesting story, awesome worlds to explore, so many secrets to find, viable builds, loot to discover. It's difficult without being excessively frustrating. The archetypes are fantastically different from each other, the guns and melee weapons are weird and cool (some could maybe use buffs although maybe they are just build specific?). I mean I have a gun that is fricking made of fingers... and that sounds kinda gross and horrifying and it kinda is but it also looks really damn good.\r\n\r\nCan't recommend this game enough.", "timestamp_created": 1772292248, "timestamp_updated": 1772292248, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507220208644866943", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219449776", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046646825", "personaname": "Wakingfate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046646825/", "num_games_owned": 79, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2576, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 351, "last_played": 1774830647, "avatar": "022a92522a78795d0e09a85334190aed42fc9b16"}, "language": "english", "review": "After playing Remnant 1, this game is leaps and bounds ahead in terms of taking what worked well in the first game and expanding. The environments are stunning and so many new rings and relics to discover! Would definitely recommend for anyone who played the first game and loved it; although, knowledge of the first game isn't necessarily needed to enjoy this one (just some story references)", "timestamp_created": 1772292246, "timestamp_updated": 1772292246, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}